text Route2_ViridianForest_SouthEntrance_Text_ForestIsMaze {
    "Are you going to Viridian Forest?\n"
    "It's a natural maze in there.\l"
    "Be careful you don't get lost.$"
}

text Route2_ViridianForest_SouthEntrance_Text_RattataHasWickedBite {
    "Rattata may be small, but don't\n"
    "underestimate its wicked bite.\p"
    "Have you caught one already?$"
}
